<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="2cc032c7"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="2bd5db3c">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Describe the workflow - provide a high level description of the workflow and the business requirement that will be
        addressed by the workflow
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define the process flow - depict the flow diagram&amp;nbsp;of the workflow
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Describe the triggering events -&amp;nbsp;define the triggering events in the workflow level including transactions and
        batch programs
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Describe the start conditions - explain the start conditions of the workflow (e.g., check for specific material
        group, check for PO value between certain range)
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
