<attribute name="name" nodeId="b403191b">Design screen layouts and flows</attribute>
<attribute name="guid" nodeId="89ef477f">_clV3QCpCEeWUXoxRhMgajw</attribute>
<attribute name="presentationName" nodeId="9e44e71b">Design screen layouts and flows</attribute>
<attribute name="briefDescription" nodeId="e3cc2a73"></attribute>
<attribute name="suppressed" nodeId="c012a3ca">false</attribute>
<attribute name="orderingGuide" nodeId="b14951c5"></attribute>
<attribute name="variabilityType" nodeId="53a0e5c7">na</attribute>
<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="16494e07"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="584f014d">&lt;p&gt;
    Design screen layouts and screen flows for the identified objects. This provides visualization of screen layouts and
    screen flows of the proposed graphical user interface (GUI) so that the stakeholders can visualize and confirm the
    proposed screen flow and navigation. This helps in early detection of any gaps in expectations that should be taken
    into consideration.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Design the screen layout and flows by:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Creating solution screen layouts and screen flows for identified requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conducting reviews of screen layouts and screen flows with stakeholders and gather their inputs
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Reworking any user interface requirements based on stakeholder feedback
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirming review of final screen layouts and screen flows after rework
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Make sure stakeholders are involved in order to validate and confirm the proposed solution screen layout and screen
    flows.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
